  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We have been given that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mmultiscripts><mo>:</mo><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mn>3</mn><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p>We know that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mmultiscripts><mi>C</mi><mi>r</mi><none></none><mprescripts></mprescripts><none></none><mi>n</mi></mmultiscripts><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>!</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>n</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced><mn>4</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>8</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mn>8</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mn>8</mn></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>88</mn><mn>44</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>Therefore, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
